{"4540040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Soul General", "steam_appid": 4540040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Background</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three thousand years ago, the living beings of the world first tasted the method of spiritual energy cultivation. Both demons and humans could cultivate for a hundred years to transform into spirits. A human woman, with a hundred years of cultivation, transcended beyond the two realms. Over the next three hundred years, she guided some of the human race to cultivate this method, thereby laying the foundation for humanity. Thus, the human race, the demon race, and the spirit race entered a hundred-year war, known in history as the 'Lingwo Rebellion'. Players will take on the role of human warriors defending their homeland against foreign invaders, leading their armies to reclaim lost lands and restore peace to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540040/extras/5e778fe96879f24d844f9a853d981fa4.poster.avif?t=1788163583\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540040/extras/5e778fe96879f24d844f9a853d981fa4.webm?t=1788163583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540040/extras/5e778fe96879f24d844f9a853d981fa4.mp4?t=1788163583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is an ancient-style musou roguelike action game. Players will lead a powerful allied squad to charge into enemy lines and resist invasion. As players progress, more mysterious events and ultimate challenges will be unveiled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540040/extras/04f96e634e4b53e043bdd9a688838579.poster.avif?t=1788163583\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540040/extras/04f96e634e4b53e043bdd9a688838579.webm?t=1788163583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540040/extras/04f96e634e4b53e043bdd9a688838579.mp4?t=1788163583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battlefield Confrontation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each playthrough, players lead their squad to challenge hordes of enemies, obtain random rewards per run, and find a powerful combination to achieve victory. Recruit more troops; you can choose to strengthen yourself or enhance your army, letting them charge into battle for glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540040/extras/6f2f4b6190e31a3f23f25af94e8ad17a.poster.avif?t=1788163583\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540040/extras/6f2f4b6190e31a3f23f25af94e8ad17a.webm?t=1788163583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540040/extras/6f2f4b6190e31a3f23f25af94e8ad17a.mp4?t=1788163583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features various build combinations. Players can choose their preferred combination to clear the game, gaining abundant combat skills and resources in each challenge. These resources can be used back at the base to permanently enhance specific attributes, making players stronger and the experience more enjoyable with each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540040/extras/c0eaca61ff847146dd7586de3591a51e.poster.avif?t=1788163583\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540040/extras/c0eaca61ff847146dd7586de3591a51e.webm?t=1788163583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540040/extras/c0eaca61ff847146dd7586de3591a51e.mp4?t=1788163583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen Your Squad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each challenge grants you abundant resources and new troop types. Recruit, upgrade, and fight alongside them, as they will become indispensable assistants in future battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540040/extras/20ec21f5a219e6c0a1d5f5136fa8d015.poster.avif?t=1788163583\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540040/extras/20ec21f5a219e6c0a1d5f5136fa8d015.webm?t=1788163583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540040/extras/20ec21f5a219e6c0a1d5f5136fa8d015.mp4?t=1788163583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuously complete specific objectives, discover new events and encounters, unlock new playable characters and equipment, thereby revealing more secrets.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Background</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three thousand years ago, the living beings of the world first tasted the method of spiritual energy cultivation. Both demons and humans could cultivate f